[h1]Tributary Expansion Directives — 驱策朝贡国[/h1]

Tell a direct AI tributary exactly where you want it to expand.

[list]
[*]Right-click your direct AI tributary and issue an Expansion Directive.
[*]Choose an eligible neighboring foreign county.
[*]Spend 150 Prestige to make the demand. Your Prestige level also affects acceptance.
[*]Optionally offer 12 months of the tributary's income as a war subsidy, clamped to 50–500 Gold and paid only if the order is accepted.
[*]On acceptance, the tributary becomes the primary attacker in a dedicated county conquest. Victory gives the county to the tributary, not the suzerain.
[*]A refusal spends the Prestige and keeps the five-year cooldown, but transfers no Gold.
[/list]

The mod preserves vanilla conquest, tributary-network, herder, truce, alliance, and war restrictions through a second legality check before war starts.

[h1]驱策朝贡国[/h1]

让你的直属 AI 朝贡国向你指定的方向扩张。

[list]
[*]右键直属 AI 朝贡国，选择“发布拓疆令”。
[*]从与其陆地接壤的合资格外国伯爵领中选择目标。
[*]每次有效命令消耗 150 威望；宗主的威望等级也会影响接受度。
[*]可额外提供战争金：朝贡国 12 个月收入，最低 50、最高 500 金币，仅在接受后支付。
[*]接受后，朝贡国会作为主攻方发动专用单伯爵领征服战争；胜利领土归朝贡国，不归宗主。
[*]拒绝会损失威望并保留五年冷却，但不会支付金币。
[/list]

[h2]Compatibility / 兼容性[/h2]
Compatible with CK3 1.21.0.3 (Florin). No DLC or other mod is required. The directive, costs, AI response, subsidy, conquest rules and existing save-data structure are retained. Back up saves before changing the game version or mod set. Mods replacing the same character interactions or casus-belli behavior may affect compatibility.

兼容CK3 1.21.0.3（Florin）。无需 DLC，无其他 mod 依赖。拓疆令、费用、AI 回应、战争金、征服规则和原有存档结构保持不变。更换游戏版本或模组组合前请备份存档；修改相同角色交互或宣战理由行为的模组可能影响兼容性。

[h2]1.0.2 validation scope / 本轮验收范围[/h2]
On CK3 1.21.0.3, a bounded two-day controlled regression exercised the original production refusal and subsidized-acceptance effects: Prestige retention, Gold transfer, war creation and the scripted attacker/defender role check. The session ended normally. This did not exercise sending through the production county selector or a natural AI response. Completed war outcomes, directional truce/expiry, direct tributary contract display and current save/reload remain outside this check. Historical 1.0.1 results retain their CK3 1.20.0.4 scope.
在CK3 1.21.0.3的有限两日受控回归中，执行原正式拒绝和资助接受效果，核对威望消耗保留、金币转移、战争发起及脚本中的进攻／防守角色断言，并正常结束。本场没有验证从正式选地界面发送命令或AI自然回应；完整战争结局、定向停战及到期、直属朝贡契约显示和新版保存重载仍不在本次范围。1.0.1旧验收继续只归属当时的CK3 1.20.0.4。
